    {
      "key": "docs/v1/authentication/api-keys",
      "parentKey": "docs/v1/authentication",
      "slug": "api-keys",
      "title": "Authenticate with an API key",
      "content": "<!-- docspress:{\"version\":1,\"key\":\"docs/v1/authentication/api-keys\",\"source\":\"examples/versioning/docs/authentication/api-keys.v1.md\",\"hash\":\"d3d0de8a9f0e6b193a61b41674c96ec678fff3ea197d8f488cd2439dac4f3186\",\"docsVersion\":\"v1\",\"logicalRoute\":\"authentication/api-keys\",\"identity\":\"v1:authentication/api-keys\",\"sourceType\":\"suffix\",\"latest\":false,\"sourceContentBase64\":\"LS0tCnRpdGxlOiBBdXRoZW50aWNhdGUgd2l0aCBhbiBBUEkga2V5CnNpZGViYXJfcG9zaXRpb246IDIKLS0tCgpWZXJzaW9uIDEgc2VuZHMgYSBsb25nLWxpdmVkIEFQSSBrZXkgd2l0aCBldmVyeSByZXF1ZXN0OgoKYGBgaHR0cApYLUFQSS1LZXk6IDxhcGkta2V5PgpgYGAKClVwZ3JhZGUgdG8gYSBuZXdlciBBUEkgYmVmb3JlIHJvdGF0aW5nIHByb2R1Y3Rpb24gY3JlZGVudGlhbHMuCg==\",\"sidebarPosition\":2} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Version 1 sends a long-lived API key with every request:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"language-http\">X-API-Key: &lt;api-key&gt;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Upgrade to a newer API before rotating production credentials.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
      "sourcePath": "examples/versioning/docs/authentication/api-keys.v1.md",
      "depth": 4,
      "menuOrder": 2,
      "version": "v1",
      "logicalRoute": "authentication/api-keys",
      "stableIdentity": "v1:authentication/api-keys",
      "sourceType": "suffix",
      "docsRoot": "docs",
      "versionContainer": false
    },
    {
      "key": "docs/v2/authentication/api-keys",
      "parentKey": "docs/v2/authentication",
      "slug": "api-keys",
      "title": "Authenticate with an API key",
      "content": "<!-- docspress:{\"version\":1,\"key\":\"docs/v2/authentication/api-keys\",\"source\":\"examples/versioning/docs/v2/authentication/api-keys.md\",\"hash\":\"a9d5fb2bcd3eacc87c075b4ae2dbffbaef2b03661b21cbb3adc1c452bd77402e\",\"docsVersion\":\"v2\",\"logicalRoute\":\"authentication/api-keys\",\"identity\":\"v2:authentication/api-keys\",\"sourceType\":\"directory\",\"latest\":false,\"sourceContentBase64\":\"\",\"sidebarPosition\":2} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Version 2 accepts an API key in the request header:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"language-http\">X-API-Key: &lt;api-key&gt;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The key flow is not available in version 3, so switching to v3 demonstrates the version-root fallback.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
      "sourcePath": "examples/versioning/docs/v2/authentication/api-keys.md",
      "depth": 4,
      "menuOrder": 2,
      "version": "v2",
      "logicalRoute": "authentication/api-keys",
      "stableIdentity": "v2:authentication/api-keys",
      "sourceType": "directory",
      "docsRoot": "docs",
      "versionContainer": false
    },
    {
      "key": "docs/v3/authentication/oauth",
      "parentKey": "docs/v3/authentication",
      "slug": "oauth",
      "title": "Authenticate with OAuth",
      "content": "<!-- docspress:{\"version\":1,\"key\":\"docs/v3/authentication/oauth\",\"source\":\"examples/versioning/docs/authentication/oauth.md\",\"hash\":\"0a63c58397bb767178e7e6b4aef9c3229f38c2ba80affec8e06414afe7155405\",\"docsVersion\":\"v3\",\"logicalRoute\":\"authentication/oauth\",\"identity\":\"v3:authentication/oauth\",\"sourceType\":\"root\",\"latest\":true,\"sourceContentBase64\":\"\",\"sidebarPosition\":2} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Version 3 uses short-lived OAuth access tokens:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code class=\"language-http\">Authorization: Bearer &lt;access-token&gt;</code></pre>\n<!-- /wp:code -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>OAuth replaces the API-key flow documented in older versions. Selecting v1 or v2 from this Page demonstrates the missing-counterpart fallback.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
      "sourcePath": "examples/versioning/docs/authentication/oauth.md",
      "depth": 4,
      "menuOrder": 2,
      "version": "v3",
      "logicalRoute": "authentication/oauth",
      "stableIdentity": "v3:authentication/oauth",
      "sourceType": "root",
      "docsRoot": "docs",
      "versionContainer": false
    }
  ]
